		"description": "<p>You draw forth eldritch spirits, the unquiet dead, or demonic spirits and force them to your bidding. Choose up to 8 unoccupied squares within 60ft. Each square becomes occupied by one Spirit Entity with AC equal to your combat maneuver DC and 20 HP. On your turn, you can teleport to a space occupied by any one of your spirit entities, shunting it to the space you previously occupied. Doing so reduces your movement speed to 0 until the start of your next turn.</p>",
